      "text": "# evo DeepSeek Harness bundle. Installed profiles apply this layer after\n# their existing bundles and before the user's cordis.patch.yml overrides.\n- insert:\n    - id: evo\n      name: \"@tiz36/evo/cordis\"\n      config: {}\n\n    - id: evo-deepseek\n      name: \"@tiz36/evo/deepseek\"\n      config:\n        provider: !!js process.env.EVO_PROVIDER?.trim() || process.env.EVO_MEMORY_PROVIDER?.trim() || 'deepseek-official'\n        model: !!js process.env.EVO_MODEL?.trim() || process.env.EVO_MEMORY_MODEL?.trim() || 'deepseek-v4-flash'\n        recallLimit: 40\n        maxContextChars: 6000\n        reflect: true\n\n    # Web client carrier: a no-op host row named by the package itself so the\n    # dsh-client-modules scan discovers evo's dsh.client bundle and\n    # serves it as /plugins/@tiz36/evo/client.js (subpath names cannot resolve\n    # <name>/package.json and would never be discovered).\n    - id: evo-web\n      name: \"@tiz36/evo\"\n      config: {}\n"
